Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1 - Escopo do Projeto", "BookChapterTitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.985034908481251*^9, 3.9850349118565884`*^9}, {
  3.9850372739129944`*^9, 3.9850372914896183`*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"SemiBold",
 Background->GrayLevel[
  0.85],ExpressionUUID->"2cb7ba20-606a-4943-8af0-c890e09a3581"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1.1 - Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.512208450234375*^9, 3.512208551265625*^9}, {
   3.51220858384375*^9, 3.51220858459375*^9}, {3.5122086178125*^9, 
   3.512208627015625*^9}, {3.51220866171875*^9, 3.512208674984375*^9}, {
   3.512208738453125*^9, 3.512208747890625*^9}, {3.984683404368189*^9, 
   3.984683421248228*^9}, {3.984689858265499*^9, 3.9846898636685123`*^9}, {
   3.9850371266571045`*^9, 3.985037138376423*^9}, 3.9850373003127937`*^9, {
   3.985085383441437*^9, 3.985085400735528*^9}},
 FontFamily->
  "Bookman Old Style",ExpressionUUID->"3d058aad-7570-4e16-b4c8-26441be4ba99"],

Cell["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/1502340", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9848349589015617`*^9},
 FontFamily->
  "Bookman Old Style",ExpressionUUID->"dd835dfb-4061-40b9-9842-e789ca96a6b3"],

Cell["\<\
A odometria \[EAcute] uma t\[EAcute]cnica amplamente utilizada para estimar, \
de forma aproximada, a posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o e a orienta\[CCedilla]\
\[ATilde]o de um rob\[OHat] m\[OAcute]vel ao longo do tempo, com base na medi\
\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o do deslocamento de suas rodas.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.98503453841724*^9}, {
  3.9850346142169304`*^9, 3.985034640055441*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"b9bbf279-eadc-2746-923e-ece488f3440b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Um dos sensores mais comuns usados para esse fim \[EAcute] o ",
 StyleBox["encoder",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " incremental, um dispositivo que conta os giros (ou incrementos de rota\
\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o) de cada roda, permitindo calcular a dist\[AHat]ncia \
percorrida."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.98503453841724*^9}, {
  3.9850346142169304`*^9, 3.985034634960232*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"bfc84e2c-d97c-674e-83a8-c0466a940f70"],

Cell["\<\
A ideia por tr\[AAcute]s do processo de odometria envolve a \
integra\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o num\[EAcute]rica do movimento do rob\[OHat] ao \
longo do tempo. \[CapitalEAcute] evidente que qualquer erro proveniente dos \
sensores \[LongDash] como imprecis\[OTilde]es na leitura da dire\[CCedilla]\
\[ATilde]o ou dist\[AHat]ncia percorrida \[LongDash] interfere diretamente na \
determina\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o da posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o. Isso ocorre \
porque esses erros tendem a se acumular ao longo do tempo, \[AGrave] medida \
que o rob\[OHat] percorre o caminho em busca de seu destino.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.98503453841724*^9}, {
  3.9850345986796284`*^9, 3.985034599048172*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"22d23237-668b-6049-8102-481bc1f1e9e8"],

Cell["\<\
Esse m\[EAcute]todo \[EAcute] bastante vi\[AAcute]vel quando o destino est\
\[AAcute] relativamente pr\[OAcute]ximo do ponto de partida, pois \[EAcute] \
simples de implementar e fornece uma boa aproxima\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o da \
posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.985034524471918*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"4b0b7a8a-0982-5742-b4e3-9fd10a3522af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A odometria \[EAcute] normalmente realizada com base nos dados dos ",
 StyleBox["encoders",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " localizados nas rodas do rob\[OHat], assumindo que as revolu\[CCedilla]\
\[OTilde]es das rodas correspondem a deslocamentos lineares em \
rela\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o ao solo."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.985034452976671*^9}, {
  3.98503449180731*^9, 3.985034497520212*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"dcfdfd35-96d9-9f4a-9c3c-69c5658f66e3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Considere um rob\[OHat] diferencial com duas rodas, cada uma equipada com \
um ",
 StyleBox["encoder",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " incremental. A dist\[AHat]ncia entre as rodas (eixo) \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[EAcute] de 0,4 m, e o raio de cada roda (direita \
",
 StyleBox["rR",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " e esquerda ",
 StyleBox["rL",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ") \[EAcute] 0,1 m, ou seja, ",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " = ",
 StyleBox["rR",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " = ",
 StyleBox["rL",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.9850344518561573`*^9, 3.9850344669679394`*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"be067e20-9e3f-674d-9983-036b9e3991ad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Assuma que o rob\[OHat] parte da posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o inicial (x0 , \
y0) = (0 , 0) com orienta\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o ",
 StyleBox["\[Psi]0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " = 0 ",
 StyleBox["rad",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850286569166737`*^9, 3.985028664886801*^9}, {
  3.985030430180023*^9, 3.9850304472707577`*^9}, {3.985032275824978*^9, 
  3.9850323127990894`*^9}, {3.985034447591671*^9, 3.985034448840267*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"2d26c9df-1f3d-cb43-956e-7d95f3c6fac7"],

