Cell["Onde:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850326316247463`*^9, 3.98503273440818*^9}, {
  3.98503276910417*^9, 3.9850327708158073`*^9}, {3.9850339688403893`*^9, 
  3.985034013496153*^9}, {3.985073937362624*^9, 3.985073939314229*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"bc9e5757-9a7f-48a6-acd8-2bf0fb58202b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote](",
 StyleBox["x ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["y",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ")\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] representa a posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o do rob\
\[OHat] no plano cartesiano.\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Psi]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[EAcute] o \[AHat]ngulo de orienta\[CCedilla]\
\[ATilde]o do rob\[OHat] em rela\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o ao \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]eixo ",
 StyleBox["x",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[EAcute] a velocidade linear e \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[EAcute] a velocidade angular aplicada ao rob\
\[OHat].\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[EAcute] a dist\[AHat]ncia entre o eixo virtual \
que une as rodas do rob\[OHat] e o ponto de aplica\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o do \
controle."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850326316247463`*^9, 3.98503273440818*^9}, {
   3.98503276910417*^9, 3.9850327708158073`*^9}, {3.9850339688403893`*^9, 
   3.985034013496153*^9}, 3.9850739433525543`*^9},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"fb41ac80-b207-0f4b-81b6-41e526115f04"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Em fun\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o dos dados de velocidade das rodas direta e \
esquerda do rob\[OHat], determine a rota navegada, sabendo que \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote] = 0,10 m. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850329144081135`*^9, {3.9850340235762024`*^9, 3.985034027712799*^9}, {
   3.9850739925932283`*^9, 3.985073994804243*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"373bc51e-99f5-c746-8ff8-fa1043b7cb85"],

Cell["Para tal, realize os seguintes passos:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850329144081135`*^9, {3.9850340235762024`*^9, 3.985034027712799*^9}, 
   3.985073989315604*^9},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"e9277478-82e5-4b2b-8f08-a579398de7e9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Realize a leitura do arquivo de dados \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["wRwL.txt",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], o qual possui 400 linhas e 3 colunas. Em outras \
palavras, o arquivo cont\[EAcute]m 400 medidas de tempo, velocidade da roda \
direita \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]R",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] e velocidade da roda esquerda \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]L",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\n2. Para demonstrar a evolu\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o \
temporal das velocidades das rodas, plote os gr\[AAcute]ficos que relaciona o \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "x",
 StyleBox[" \[Omega]R",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] e o \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "x ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]L",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\n3. Transforme as velocidades \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]R\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "e \[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]L\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " em sinais de controle \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["u\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " e \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ".\n4. Para demonstrar a evolu\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o temporal dos sinais de \
controle do rob\[OHat], plote os gr\[AAcute]ficos que relacionam o \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "x",
 StyleBox[" u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] e o \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " x ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850327750489693`*^9, {3.985032898384186*^9, 3.9850331742723236`*^9}, {
   3.985033240289135*^9, 3.985033261624113*^9}, {3.9850337596483383`*^9, 
   3.985033776864916*^9}, {3.9850340355051765`*^9, 3.9850340419921265`*^9}, 
   3.985074051618252*^9, 3.9850797015247307`*^9},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"7e794a30-234c-594d-81d3-adc21617b410"],

Cell["\<\
5. Use o modelo cinem\[AAcute]tico, para determinar a \
posi\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o e orienta\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o do rob\[OHat] ao \
longo do tempo. A t\[IAcute]tulo de exemplo, para determinar a orienta\
\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o do rob\[OHat], fa\[CCedilla]a: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850332878540154`*^9, {3.9850333320733185`*^9, 3.9850334311072197`*^9}, {
   3.985033791177353*^9, 3.98503379204274*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
