Cell["So, realize the follow steps:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850329144081135`*^9, {3.9850340235762024`*^9, 3.985034027712799*^9}, 
   3.985073989315604*^9, {3.985085879807837*^9, 3.9850859026873817`*^9}, {
   3.985085953535602*^9, 3.9850859571382313`*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"fafd3e99-541a-49c4-9314-f66241dfd755"],

Cell["step 1 - Realize the charge to dataset... ", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850862708526382`*^9, 3.9850863135179577`*^9}},
 FontFamily->
  "Bookman Old Style",ExpressionUUID->"671fabac-970a-4e82-b7cf-f6bda97758ab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Realize a leitura do arquivo de dados \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["wRwL.txt",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], o qual possui 400 linhas e 3 colunas. Em outras \
palavras, o arquivo cont\[EAcute]m 400 medidas de tempo, velocidade da roda \
direita \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]R",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] e velocidade da roda esquerda \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]L",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9850327750489693`*^9, {3.985032898384186*^9, 3.9850331742723236`*^9}, {
   3.985033240289135*^9, 3.985033261624113*^9}, {3.9850337596483383`*^9, 
   3.985033776864916*^9}, {3.9850340355051765`*^9, 3.9850340419921265`*^9}, 
   3.985074051618252*^9, 3.9850797015247307`*^9, 3.985086393701086*^9},
 FontFamily->"Bookman Old Style",
 FontWeight->"Light",ExpressionUUID->"0269485f-9830-4f17-9a75-e1076d1adf6e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "2. Para demonstrar a evolu\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o temporal das velocidades \
das rodas, plote os gr\[AAcute]ficos que relaciona o \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "x",
 StyleBox[" \[Omega]R",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] e o \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["tempo ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "x ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]L",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
